  ('writing-fashion-club-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the proposed fashion event. I find the situation exciting. Overall, I believe a live fashion-show event would be more memorable. First, the club should invite several designers and include a moderated question session. This would give members direct contact with professionals. I also recommend that it stream the show for members who cannot attend, which would keep the event accessible. In addition, it would be useful to offer affordable tickets and a small design workshop. Together, these measures could combine inspiration, accessibility and practical learning while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the proposed fashion event. I find the situation exciting. Overall, I believe a live fashion-show event would be more memorable. First, the club should invite several designers and include a moderated question session. This would give members direct contact with professionals. I also recommend that it stream the show for members who cannot attend, which would keep the event accessible. In addition, it would be useful to offer affordable tickets and a small design workshop. Together, these measures could combine inspiration, accessibility and practical learning while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
