  ('writing-museum-club-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the proposed museum entrance fee understandable but concerning. I think a small fee is acceptable if access remains inclusive. The club should charge a modest annual membership fee instead of every visit, as this would provide predictable income. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the proposed museum entrance fee understandable but concerning. I think a small fee is acceptable if access remains inclusive. The club should charge a modest annual membership fee instead of every visit, as this would provide predictable income. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-museum-club-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the proposed museum entrance fee. I find the situation understandable but concerning. Overall, I believe a small fee is acceptable if access remains inclusive. First, the club should charge a modest annual membership fee instead of every visit. This would provide predictable income. I also recommend that it keep one free day each month and discount students and seniors, which would protect access for lower-income visitors. In addition, it would be useful to explain how the money supports exhibitions. Together, these measures could fund improvements without excluding regular members while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the proposed museum entrance fee. I find the situation understandable but concerning. Overall, I believe a small fee is acceptable if access remains inclusive. First, the club should charge a modest annual membership fee instead of every visit. This would provide predictable income. I also recommend that it keep one free day each month and discount students and seniors, which would protect access for lower-income visitors. In addition, it would be useful to explain how the money supports exhibitions. Together, these measures could fund improvements without excluding regular members while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-home-living-club-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find support for young home buyers highly valuable. I think families need independent guidance before making financial commitments. The club should create a searchable price-comparison checklist and neighbourhood guide, as this would help buyers narrow their choices. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find support for young home buyers highly valuable. I think families need independent guidance before making financial commitments. The club should create a searchable price-comparison checklist and neighbourhood guide, as this would help buyers narrow their choices. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
