  ('writing-cinema-club-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about mobile-phone use during screenings. I find the situation frustrating. Overall, I believe a complete ban is unnecessary if clear rules are enforced. First, the club should require silent mode and ask users to leave the room for urgent calls. This would protect the viewing experience. I also recommend that it show a clear reminder and appoint an usher, which would deal with repeated disruption fairly. In addition, it would be useful to provide secure phone pouches only for special screenings. Together, these measures could reduce disturbance without imposing an excessive restriction while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about mobile-phone use during screenings. I find the situation frustrating. Overall, I believe a complete ban is unnecessary if clear rules are enforced. First, the club should require silent mode and ask users to leave the room for urgent calls. This would protect the viewing experience. I also recommend that it show a clear reminder and appoint an usher, which would deal with repeated disruption fairly. In addition, it would be useful to provide secure phone pouches only for special screenings. Together, these measures could reduce disturbance without imposing an excessive restriction while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
