  ('writing-science-club-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the science exhibition. I find the situation exciting. Overall, I believe basic admission should be free to maximise participation. First, the club should offer hands-on experiments, robotics demonstrations and short public talks. This would engage visitors of different ages. I also recommend that it provide discounted tickets only for specialist workshops, which would help cover additional costs. In addition, it would be useful to use timed sessions and accessible explanations. Together, these measures could combine broad access with safe and sustainable organisation while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the science exhibition. I find the situation exciting. Overall, I believe basic admission should be free to maximise participation. First, the club should offer hands-on experiments, robotics demonstrations and short public talks. This would engage visitors of different ages. I also recommend that it provide discounted tickets only for specialist workshops, which would help cover additional costs. In addition, it would be useful to use timed sessions and accessible explanations. Together, these measures could combine broad access with safe and sustainable organisation while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-computer-club-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the Computer Club website redesign overdue and welcome. I think the new website must be simple, responsive and useful. The club should create clear menus, event pages and a prominent joining button, as this would help visitors find information quickly. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the Computer Club website redesign overdue and welcome. I think the new website must be simple, responsive and useful. The club should create clear menus, event pages and a prominent joining button, as this would help visitors find information quickly. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
