  ('writing-garden-club-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the cancelled Japanese-gardens talk. I find the situation disappointing. Overall, I believe repeating the English-gardens talk should be a last resort. First, the club should invite a local horticulturist to discuss Asian garden design. This would keep the original theme. I also recommend that it run a member photo presentation or virtual garden tour, which would require little notice. In addition, it would be useful to reschedule Mr Seiko when he recovers. Together, these measures could offer fresh content now while respecting the original speaker while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the cancelled Japanese-gardens talk. I find the situation disappointing. Overall, I believe repeating the English-gardens talk should be a last resort. First, the club should invite a local horticulturist to discuss Asian garden design. This would keep the original theme. I also recommend that it run a member photo presentation or virtual garden tour, which would require little notice. In addition, it would be useful to reschedule Mr Seiko when he recovers. Together, these measures could offer fresh content now while respecting the original speaker while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
