  ('writing-healthy-club-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about two weeks without a fitness instructor. I find the situation concerning. Overall, I believe unsupervised use should be limited for safety. First, the club should hire a qualified temporary instructor for busy periods. This would reduce the risk of injuries. I also recommend that it offer low-risk recorded classes with staff monitoring, which would maintain some organised activity. In addition, it would be useful to extend memberships or provide make-up classes. Together, these measures could protect members while compensating them fairly while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about two weeks without a fitness instructor. I find the situation concerning. Overall, I believe unsupervised use should be limited for safety. First, the club should hire a qualified temporary instructor for busy periods. This would reduce the risk of injuries. I also recommend that it offer low-risk recorded classes with staff monitoring, which would maintain some organised activity. In addition, it would be useful to extend memberships or provide make-up classes. Together, these measures could protect members while compensating them fairly while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-english-club-version-2-set002-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the cancelled English talk show disappointing. I think the club should avoid cancelling the entire weekly meeting. The club should hold a member-led speaking workshop with prepared discussion cards, as this would keep everyone practising. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the cancelled English talk show disappointing. I think the club should avoid cancelling the entire weekly meeting. The club should hold a member-led speaking workshop with prepared discussion cards, as this would keep everyone practising. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-english-club-version-2-set002-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the cancelled English talk show. I find the situation disappointing. Overall, I believe the club should avoid cancelling the entire weekly meeting. First, the club should hold a member-led speaking workshop with prepared discussion cards. This would keep everyone practising. I also recommend that it invite a local teacher to join online for questions, which would provide expert input at short notice. In addition, it would be useful to create a list of backup speakers for future events. Together, these measures could maintain continuity and respond more professionally to cancellations while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the cancelled English talk show. I find the situation disappointing. Overall, I believe the club should avoid cancelling the entire weekly meeting. First, the club should hold a member-led speaking workshop with prepared discussion cards. This would keep everyone practising. I also recommend that it invite a local teacher to join online for questions, which would provide expert input at short notice. In addition, it would be useful to create a list of backup speakers for future events. Together, these measures could maintain continuity and respond more professionally to cancellations while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
