  ('writing-language-club-version-2-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the language-learning lecture. I find the situation exciting. Overall, I believe I would be a suitable speaker on independent learning strategies. First, the club should select my talk on building a sustainable language-learning routine. This would give learners practical methods. I also recommend that it include demonstrations of spaced repetition and active listening, which would show how the techniques work. In addition, it would be useful to provide a worksheet and questions for different ability levels. Together, these measures could make the lecture credible, interactive and immediately useful while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the language-learning lecture. I find the situation exciting. Overall, I believe I would be a suitable speaker on independent learning strategies. First, the club should select my talk on building a sustainable language-learning routine. This would give learners practical methods. I also recommend that it include demonstrations of spaced repetition and active listening, which would show how the techniques work. In addition, it would be useful to provide a worksheet and questions for different ability levels. Together, these measures could make the lecture credible, interactive and immediately useful while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-community-club-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the need for community volunteers motivating. I think the club should offer clear roles and visible local impact. The club should advertise short flexible volunteer shifts with precise responsibilities, as this would make participation manageable. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the need for community volunteers motivating. I think the club should offer clear roles and visible local impact. The club should advertise short flexible volunteer shifts with precise responsibilities, as this would make participation manageable. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-community-club-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the need for community volunteers. I find the situation motivating. Overall, I believe the club should offer clear roles and visible local impact. First, the club should advertise short flexible volunteer shifts with precise responsibilities. This would make participation manageable. I also recommend that it organise a neighbourhood clean-up and digital-help sessions for seniors, which would address practical community needs. In addition, it would be useful to recognise volunteers and share project results. Together, these measures could recruit people effectively and sustain their commitment while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the need for community volunteers. I find the situation motivating. Overall, I believe the club should offer clear roles and visible local impact. First, the club should advertise short flexible volunteer shifts with precise responsibilities. This would make participation manageable. I also recommend that it organise a neighbourhood clean-up and digital-help sessions for seniors, which would address practical community needs. In addition, it would be useful to recognise volunteers and share project results. Together, these measures could recruit people effectively and sustain their commitment while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-home-living-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find guidance for young home buyers reassuring. I think the club should provide neutral information rather than sales advice. The club should offer property-comparison tools and neighbourhood visits, as this would help families judge value realistically. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find guidance for young home buyers reassuring. I think the club should provide neutral information rather than sales advice. The club should offer property-comparison tools and neighbourhood visits, as this would help families judge value realistically. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-home-living-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about guidance for young home buyers. I find the situation reassuring. Overall, I believe the club should provide neutral information rather than sales advice. First, the club should offer property-comparison tools and neighbourhood visits. This would help families judge value realistically. I also recommend that it invite legal and financial experts for independent workshops, which would explain contracts, loans and hidden costs. In addition, it would be useful to publish a checklist for inspections and negotiations. Together, these measures could help buyers make careful and confident decisions while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about guidance for young home buyers. I find the situation reassuring. Overall, I believe the club should provide neutral information rather than sales advice. First, the club should offer property-comparison tools and neighbourhood visits. This would help families judge value realistically. I also recommend that it invite legal and financial experts for independent workshops, which would explain contracts, loans and hidden costs. In addition, it would be useful to publish a checklist for inspections and negotiations. Together, these measures could help buyers make careful and confident decisions while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-walking-club-version-1-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the proposed European walking tour exciting but demanding. I think the trip is worthwhile if flexible options are provided. The club should divide the route into short stages with rest days, as this would include members with different fitness levels. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the proposed European walking tour exciting but demanding. I think the trip is worthwhile if flexible options are provided. The club should divide the route into short stages with rest days, as this would include members with different fitness levels. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-walking-club-version-1-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the proposed European walking tour. I find the situation exciting but demanding. Overall, I believe the trip is worthwhile if flexible options are provided. First, the club should divide the route into short stages with rest days. This would include members with different fitness levels. I also recommend that it offer shared rooms, early booking and fundraising walks, which would reduce the overall cost. In addition, it would be useful to provide training plans, insurance guidance and support transport. Together, these measures could make the tour safer, cheaper and more inclusive while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the proposed European walking tour. I find the situation exciting but demanding. Overall, I believe the trip is worthwhile if flexible options are provided. First, the club should divide the route into short stages with rest days. This would include members with different fitness levels. I also recommend that it offer shared rooms, early booking and fundraising walks, which would reduce the overall cost. In addition, it would be useful to provide training plans, insurance guidance and support transport. Together, these measures could make the tour safer, cheaper and more inclusive while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-beautiful-homes-club-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find replacing old buildings with apartments complex. I think historically valuable buildings should not be demolished automatically. The club should conduct independent cultural and structural assessments first, as this would identify buildings worth preserving. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find replacing old buildings with apartments complex. I think historically valuable buildings should not be demolished automatically. The club should conduct independent cultural and structural assessments first, as this would identify buildings worth preserving. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-beautiful-homes-club-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about replacing old buildings with apartments. I find the situation complex. Overall, I believe historically valuable buildings should not be demolished automatically. First, the club should conduct independent cultural and structural assessments first. This would identify buildings worth preserving. I also recommend that it convert suitable properties into housing or community spaces, which would combine conservation with practical use. In addition, it would be useful to allow redevelopment only after public consultation. Together, these measures could increase housing while protecting local identity while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about replacing old buildings with apartments. I find the situation complex. Overall, I believe historically valuable buildings should not be demolished automatically. First, the club should conduct independent cultural and structural assessments first. This would identify buildings worth preserving. I also recommend that it convert suitable properties into housing or community spaces, which would combine conservation with practical use. In addition, it would be useful to allow redevelopment only after public consultation. Together, these measures could increase housing while protecting local identity while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
