  ('writing-travel-club-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the local tourism campaign promising. I think promotion must be attractive without encouraging disrespectful tourism. The club should show local culture, nature and small businesses through short authentic videos, as this would present the area''s distinctive character. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the local tourism campaign promising. I think promotion must be attractive without encouraging disrespectful tourism. The club should show local culture, nature and small businesses through short authentic videos, as this would present the area''s distinctive character. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-travel-club-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the local tourism campaign. I find the situation promising. Overall, I believe promotion must be attractive without encouraging disrespectful tourism. First, the club should show local culture, nature and small businesses through short authentic videos. This would present the area''s distinctive character. I also recommend that it publish a simple visitor code in several languages, which would clarify respectful behaviour. In addition, it would be useful to partner with guides and accommodation providers. Together, these measures could welcome tourists while protecting residents and the environment while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the local tourism campaign. I find the situation promising. Overall, I believe promotion must be attractive without encouraging disrespectful tourism. First, the club should show local culture, nature and small businesses through short authentic videos. This would present the area''s distinctive character. I also recommend that it publish a simple visitor code in several languages, which would clarify respectful behaviour. In addition, it would be useful to partner with guides and accommodation providers. Together, these measures could welcome tourists while protecting residents and the environment while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-movie-club-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the temporary closure of the meeting room inconvenient but manageable. I think the club should use a nearby community hall. The club should reserve an accessible venue with reliable projection equipment, as this would preserve the shared cinema experience. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the temporary closure of the meeting room inconvenient but manageable. I think the club should use a nearby community hall. The club should reserve an accessible venue with reliable projection equipment, as this would preserve the shared cinema experience. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-movie-club-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the temporary closure of the meeting room. I find the situation inconvenient but manageable. Overall, I believe the club should use a nearby community hall. First, the club should reserve an accessible venue with reliable projection equipment. This would preserve the shared cinema experience. I also recommend that it offer one online discussion each month, which would include members who cannot travel. In addition, it would be useful to organise a film-location walk during the repairs. Together, these measures could keep the programme varied until the usual room reopens while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the temporary closure of the meeting room. I find the situation inconvenient but manageable. Overall, I believe the club should use a nearby community hall. First, the club should reserve an accessible venue with reliable projection equipment. This would preserve the shared cinema experience. I also recommend that it offer one online discussion each month, which would include members who cannot travel. In addition, it would be useful to organise a film-location walk during the repairs. Together, these measures could keep the programme varied until the usual room reopens while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-music-club-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the inclusive music event uplifting. I think the programme should mix familiar music with new performances. The club should schedule youth bands, community choirs and acoustic sets, as this would appeal to several generations. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the inclusive music event uplifting. I think the programme should mix familiar music with new performances. The club should schedule youth bands, community choirs and acoustic sets, as this would appeal to several generations. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-music-club-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the inclusive music event. I find the situation uplifting. Overall, I believe the programme should mix familiar music with new performances. First, the club should schedule youth bands, community choirs and acoustic sets. This would appeal to several generations. I also recommend that it provide comfortable seating, step-free access and a quiet area, which would support older and sensitive visitors. In addition, it would be useful to finish with an optional sing-along workshop. Together, these measures could make every age group feel welcome and involved while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the inclusive music event. I find the situation uplifting. Overall, I believe the programme should mix familiar music with new performances. First, the club should schedule youth bands, community choirs and acoustic sets. This would appeal to several generations. I also recommend that it provide comfortable seating, step-free access and a quiet area, which would support older and sensitive visitors. In addition, it would be useful to finish with an optional sing-along workshop. Together, these measures could make every age group feel welcome and involved while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-college-club-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the earlier examination date stressful and unfair. I think the college should provide meaningful academic flexibility. The club should publish revised revision materials and additional tutorials immediately, as this would help students prepare in less time. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the earlier examination date stressful and unfair. I think the college should provide meaningful academic flexibility. The club should publish revised revision materials and additional tutorials immediately, as this would help students prepare in less time. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-college-club-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the earlier examination date. I find the situation stressful and unfair. Overall, I believe the college should provide meaningful academic flexibility. First, the club should publish revised revision materials and additional tutorials immediately. This would help students prepare in less time. I also recommend that it allow deferrals for documented work or caring commitments, which would protect students facing genuine hardship. In addition, it would be useful to extend library hours and adjust assignment deadlines. Together, these measures could reduce disruption while maintaining academic standards while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the earlier examination date. I find the situation stressful and unfair. Overall, I believe the college should provide meaningful academic flexibility. First, the club should publish revised revision materials and additional tutorials immediately. This would help students prepare in less time. I also recommend that it allow deferrals for documented work or caring commitments, which would protect students facing genuine hardship. In addition, it would be useful to extend library hours and adjust assignment deadlines. Together, these measures could reduce disruption while maintaining academic standards while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-nature-club-version-2-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the children''s nature campaign excellent. I think the message should focus on adventure rather than lectures. The club should organise treasure hunts, wildlife challenges and short family walks, as this would make outdoor learning enjoyable. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the children''s nature campaign excellent. I think the message should focus on adventure rather than lectures. The club should organise treasure hunts, wildlife challenges and short family walks, as this would make outdoor learning enjoyable. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-nature-club-version-2-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the children''s nature campaign. I find the situation excellent. Overall, I believe the message should focus on adventure rather than lectures. First, the club should organise treasure hunts, wildlife challenges and short family walks. This would make outdoor learning enjoyable. I also recommend that it promote them through schools, parent groups and child-friendly videos, which would reach both children and families. In addition, it would be useful to use badges and team rewards for participation. Together, these measures could turn initial curiosity into regular outdoor involvement while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the children''s nature campaign. I find the situation excellent. Overall, I believe the message should focus on adventure rather than lectures. First, the club should organise treasure hunts, wildlife challenges and short family walks. This would make outdoor learning enjoyable. I also recommend that it promote them through schools, parent groups and child-friendly videos, which would reach both children and families. In addition, it would be useful to use badges and team rewards for participation. Together, these measures could turn initial curiosity into regular outdoor involvement while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-cooking-club-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the cancelled cooking classes frustrating. I think members should receive a refund or an equivalent replacement. The club should offer make-up classes on several alternative dates, as this would respect different schedules. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the cancelled cooking classes frustrating. I think members should receive a refund or an equivalent replacement. The club should offer make-up classes on several alternative dates, as this would respect different schedules. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-cooking-club-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the cancelled cooking classes. I find the situation frustrating. Overall, I believe members should receive a refund or an equivalent replacement. First, the club should offer make-up classes on several alternative dates. This would respect different schedules. I also recommend that it provide a live online lesson and ingredient voucher, which would give immediate value to members. In addition, it would be useful to allow anyone who cannot attend to request credit. Together, these measures could resolve the cancellation fairly and preserve members'' trust while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club President, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the cancelled cooking classes. I find the situation frustrating. Overall, I believe members should receive a refund or an equivalent replacement. First, the club should offer make-up classes on several alternative dates. This would respect different schedules. I also recommend that it provide a live online lesson and ingredient voucher, which would give immediate value to members. In addition, it would be useful to allow anyone who cannot attend to request credit. Together, these measures could resolve the cancellation fairly and preserve members'' trust while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-fitness-club-set002-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the proposed fitness-club cuts concerning. I think essential equipment and social facilities should be protected. The club should reduce energy use and renegotiate supplier contracts first, as this would cut costs with limited impact. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the proposed fitness-club cuts concerning. I think essential equipment and social facilities should be protected. The club should reduce energy use and renegotiate supplier contracts first, as this would cut costs with limited impact. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-fitness-club-set002-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the proposed fitness-club cuts. I find the situation concerning. Overall, I believe essential equipment and social facilities should be protected. First, the club should reduce energy use and renegotiate supplier contracts first. This would cut costs with limited impact. I also recommend that it keep the café but shorten its quiet-hour opening schedule, which would retain an important social space. In addition, it would be useful to survey members and publish the savings target. Together, these measures could make transparent savings without seriously weakening the club while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the proposed fitness-club cuts. I find the situation concerning. Overall, I believe essential equipment and social facilities should be protected. First, the club should reduce energy use and renegotiate supplier contracts first. This would cut costs with limited impact. I also recommend that it keep the café but shorten its quiet-hour opening schedule, which would retain an important social space. In addition, it would be useful to survey members and publish the savings target. Together, these measures could make transparent savings without seriously weakening the club while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-technology-club-set002-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find volunteering at the technology fair exciting. I think technology improves access, productivity and communication. The club should select me because I can explain digital tools clearly and patiently, as this would help visitors understand unfamiliar displays. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find volunteering at the technology fair exciting. I think technology improves access, productivity and communication. The club should select me because I can explain digital tools clearly and patiently, as this would help visitors understand unfamiliar displays. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-technology-club-set002-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about volunteering at the technology fair. I find the situation exciting. Overall, I believe technology improves access, productivity and communication. First, the club should select me because I can explain digital tools clearly and patiently. This would help visitors understand unfamiliar displays. I also recommend that it use my troubleshooting and teamwork experience, which would support speakers when technical problems arise. In addition, it would be useful to assign volunteers clear roles and provide a briefing. Together, these measures could deliver a reliable fair while making technology approachable while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about volunteering at the technology fair. I find the situation exciting. Overall, I believe technology improves access, productivity and communication. First, the club should select me because I can explain digital tools clearly and patiently. This would help visitors understand unfamiliar displays. I also recommend that it use my troubleshooting and teamwork experience, which would support speakers when technical problems arise. In addition, it would be useful to assign volunteers clear roles and provide a briefing. Together, these measures could deliver a reliable fair while making technology approachable while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-walking-club-version-2-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find phone use during group walks worrying. I think members should keep phones away except for navigation or emergencies. The club should begin every walk with a short safety reminder, as this would set clear expectations. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find phone use during group walks worrying. I think members should keep phones away except for navigation or emergencies. The club should begin every walk with a short safety reminder, as this would set clear expectations. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-walking-club-version-2-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about phone use during group walks. I find the situation worrying. Overall, I believe members should keep phones away except for navigation or emergencies. First, the club should begin every walk with a short safety reminder. This would set clear expectations. I also recommend that it introduce phone-free conversation sections and regular photo stops, which would encourage social interaction. In addition, it would be useful to ask walk leaders to address unsafe behaviour immediately. Together, these measures could improve attention, safety and enjoyment for the whole group while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about phone use during group walks. I find the situation worrying. Overall, I believe members should keep phones away except for navigation or emergencies. First, the club should begin every walk with a short safety reminder. This would set clear expectations. I also recommend that it introduce phone-free conversation sections and regular photo stops, which would encourage social interaction. In addition, it would be useful to ask walk leaders to address unsafe behaviour immediately. Together, these measures could improve attention, safety and enjoyment for the whole group while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-food-club-version-2-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the special chef event excellent. I think the talk should focus on nutritious meals with affordable ingredients. The club should demonstrate a colourful one-pan seasonal dish, as this would make the recipe realistic for busy members. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the special chef event excellent. I think the talk should focus on nutritious meals with affordable ingredients. The club should demonstrate a colourful one-pan seasonal dish, as this would make the recipe realistic for busy members. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-food-club-version-2-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the special chef event. I find the situation excellent. Overall, I believe the talk should focus on nutritious meals with affordable ingredients. First, the club should demonstrate a colourful one-pan seasonal dish. This would make the recipe realistic for busy members. I also recommend that it include tasting portions and a question session, which would encourage participation. In addition, it would be useful to hold a short challenge using leftover ingredients. Together, these measures could make the event practical, entertaining and memorable while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the special chef event. I find the situation excellent. Overall, I believe the talk should focus on nutritious meals with affordable ingredients. First, the club should demonstrate a colourful one-pan seasonal dish. This would make the recipe realistic for busy members. I also recommend that it include tasting portions and a question session, which would encourage participation. In addition, it would be useful to hold a short challenge using leftover ingredients. Together, these measures could make the event practical, entertaining and memorable while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-fashion-club-version-2-p4-q001', '{"sample_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the two fashion-event options exciting. I think the live fashion show would offer a richer experience. The club should combine designer presentations with a well-paced runway show, as this would let members examine designs and meet creators. What do you think? Best, Sam","model_answer":"Hi Alex, I find the two fashion-event options exciting. I think the live fashion show would offer a richer experience. The club should combine designer presentations with a well-paced runway show, as this would let members examine designs and meet creators. What do you think? Best, Sam","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}'),
  ('writing-fashion-club-version-2-p4-q002', '{"sample_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the two fashion-event options. I find the situation exciting. Overall, I believe the live fashion show would offer a richer experience. First, the club should combine designer presentations with a well-paced runway show. This would let members examine designs and meet creators. I also recommend that it stream the main sessions and accept online questions, which would include members who cannot travel. In addition, it would be useful to add a styling workshop and sustainable-fashion display. Together, these measures could create an inclusive event with strong educational value while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","model_answer":"Dear Club Manager, I am writing in response to the recent notice about the two fashion-event options. I find the situation exciting. Overall, I believe the live fashion show would offer a richer experience. First, the club should combine designer presentations with a well-paced runway show. This would let members examine designs and meet creators. I also recommend that it stream the main sessions and accept online questions, which would include members who cannot travel. In addition, it would be useful to add a styling workshop and sustainable-fashion display. Together, these measures could create an inclusive event with strong educational value while addressing members’ concerns in a fair and practical way. Thank you for considering my suggestions. I hope they will help the club make an inclusive and well-informed decision. Yours faithfully, Sam Nguyen","explanation":null,"rubric":null,"status":{"missing_model_answer":false,"missing_rubric":true}}')
) AS a(question_source_key, solution_data)
JOIN public.aptis_questions q ON q.skill = 'writing'::public.aptis_skill_enum AND q.source_key = a.question_source_key
ON CONFLICT (question_id) DO UPDATE SET
  solution_data = EXCLUDED.solution_data
WHERE aptis_question_answers.solution_data IS DISTINCT FROM EXCLUDED.solution_data;

COMMIT;
